        "title": "The plans below show a small theatre in 2010, and the same theatre in 2012. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HpIOdsYZvolZUBxjRSNl2bGagMb\"><em><strong>The plans below show a small theatre in 2010, and the same theatre in 2012. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Small Theatre: 2010 &amp; 2012</em></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i <em>Small Theatre: 2010 &amp; 2012 </em>y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả bố cục của một nh&agrave; h&aacute;t nhỏ qua 2 giai đoạn:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<ul>\n<li>H&igrave;nh 1 (b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i): Bố cục nh&agrave; h&aacute;t v&agrave;o năm 2010</li>\n<li>H&igrave;nh 2 (b&ecirc;n phải): Bố cục nh&agrave; h&aacute;t v&agrave;o năm 2012</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề&nbsp;<em>Small Theatre: 2010 &amp; 2012</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục của nh&agrave; h&aacute;t năm 2010 - những thay đổi sau khi cải tạo v&agrave;o năm 2012.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Thay đổi 1:</strong> <em>S&acirc;n khấu (stage)</em> v&agrave; <em>kh&aacute;n ph&ograve;ng (auditorium) </em>vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Thay đổi 2:</strong> Phần lớn c&aacute;c khu vực hỗ trợ được t&aacute;i bố tr&iacute;, với hai ph&ograve;ng mới được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i theo 2 khu vực ch&iacute;nh: <strong>(1)</strong> Khu vực hướng Bắc v&agrave;<strong> (2)</strong> Khu vực hướng Nam</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Những thay đổi ở khu vực hướng Bắc</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả vị tr&iacute; của Stage, Dressing room v&agrave; Showers</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>S&acirc;n khấu (stage)</em> vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m, <em>nằm ngay ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n kh&aacute;n ph&ograve;ng (directly above the auditorium)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Ph&ograve;ng thay đồ (dressing room)</em>,<em> ban đầu chiếm một diện t&iacute;ch lớn ở ph&iacute;a Bắc (originally occupied a large area in the north)</em>, đ&atilde; được thu nhỏ đ&aacute;ng kể v&agrave;<em> di dời sang ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y của t&ograve;a nh&agrave; (relocated to the western side of the building)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Một <em>ph&ograve;ng tắm mới (shower facility)</em> được <em>x&acirc;y ngay b&ecirc;n cạnh ph&ograve;ng thay đồ (added adjacent to it)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả vị tr&iacute; của Coordination room v&agrave; Admin office</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Thay v&agrave;o vị tr&iacute; ph&ograve;ng thay đồ cũ, một <em>ph&ograve;ng điều phối mới (coordination room)</em> được x&acirc;y dựng</li>\n<li><em>Văn ph&ograve;ng h&agrave;nh ch&iacute;nh (admin office)</em> <em>được di dời từ g&oacute;c T&acirc;y Nam l&ecirc;n g&oacute;c Đ&ocirc;ng Bắc (repositioned to the northeast corner, having been moved from its original location in the southwest)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> Những thay đổi ở khu vực hướng Nam</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1)<strong> M&ocirc; tả vị tr&iacute; của Auditorium, Storage v&agrave; Restaurant:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Kh&aacute;n ph&ograve;ng (auditorium)</em> với ba h&agrave;ng ghế vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n trong suốt giai đoạn hai năm</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Khu vực lưu trữ (storage area)</em> <em>được di dời từ g&oacute;c T&acirc;y Bắc xuống g&oacute;c T&acirc;y Nam (relocated from the northwest corner to the southwest)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Thay v&agrave;o vị tr&iacute; của văn ph&ograve;ng h&agrave;nh ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng b&aacute;n v&eacute; cũ (in place of the former admin and ticket offices)</em>,<em> </em>một nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng lớn hơn được x&acirc;y dựng</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả vị tr&iacute; của Ticket office v&agrave; Main door</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Ph&ograve;ng b&aacute;n v&eacute; (ticket office)</em> <em>được chuyển sang g&oacute;c Đ&ocirc;ng Nam (moved to the southeast corner)</em>, <em>vị tr&iacute; cũ của qu&aacute;n cafe (where the cafe had previously been located)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Cửa ch&iacute;nh (main door)</em> vẫn <em>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m ở ph&iacute;a trước t&ograve;a nh&agrave; (retained its central position at the front of the building)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
